# --- Fork: machine-local ops state (see FORK.md "Tracked vs machine-local")
# Dev-build binaries live at the repo root and are machine-local artifacts.
/custom-syncthing-*
# tmp/ holds logs, the CURRENT-BINARY pointer, launch scripts, and incident
# evidence — all machine-local. Only the listed design/ops docs are tracked;
# adding anything else from tmp/ requires git add -f, by design, so that no
# log or script with credentials ever rides along accidentally.
tmp/*
!tmp/CUSTOM-SERVE.md
!tmp/btrfs-scan-replay.md
!tmp/syncpreparing-linger.md
